- Products: AS-603 Oral Treponeme Enrichment Broth (OTEB) 10 tubes / pkg"}, {"step": "Intended Use: OTEB is an enriched medium for the isolation, cultivation and maintenance of Treponemes found as part of the oral flora."}, {"step": "OTEB is a complex peptone-yeast extract medium containing volatile fatty acids and serum for a source of long chain fatty acids. Volatile fatty acids and serum are necessary nutrients for recovery of Treponemes from the oral flora. Inoculation of the medium can be done using a gassing cannula or inside an anaerobic chamber. This medium is prepared, stored and dispensed under oxygen-free conditions to prevent the formation of oxidized products prior to use."}, {"step": "Final pH 7.0 +/- 0.2 at 25 degrees C."}, {"step": "Final volume 7.0 ml +/- 0.7."}]}, {"id": 5688, "name": "Sugar Stock Solution", "volume": 1000, "recipe": [{"recipe_order": 1, "compound": "Glucose", "compound_id": 5, "amount": 8, "unit": "g", "g_l": 8, "mmol_l": 44.405, "optional": 0}, {"recipe_order": 2, "compound": "Fructose", "compound_id": 98, "amount": 8, "unit": "g", "g_l": 8, "mmol_l": 44.405, "optional": 0}, {"recipe_order": 3, "compound": "Sucrose", "compound_id": 108, "amount": 8, "unit": "g", "g_l": 8, "mmol_l": 23.3713, "optional": 0}, {"recipe_order": 4, "compound": "Maltose", "compound_id": 171, "amount": 8, "unit": "g", "g_l": 8, "mmol_l": 23.3713, "optional": 0}, {"recipe_order": 5, "compound": "Maltose", "compound_id": 171, "amount": 8, "unit": "g", "g_l": 8, "mmol_l": 23.3713, "optional": 0}, {"recipe_order": 6, "compound": "Ribose", "compound_id": 168, "amount": 8, "unit": "g", "g_l": 8, "mmol_l": 53.2872, "optional": 0}, {"recipe_order": 7, "compound": "Xylose", "compound_id": 1107, "amount": 8, "unit": "g", "g_l": 8, "mmol_l": 53.2872, "optional": 0}, {"recipe_order": 8, "compound": "Pectin", "compound_id": 1108, "amount": 8, "unit": "g", "g_l": 8, "mmol_l": 41.2074, "optional": 0}, {"recipe_order": 9, "compound": "Starch", "compound_id": 199, "attri